### 4.3 The Genesis Flow

Every claim in SCOS follows the Fractal Binary protocol:

> **Witness** (Encounter) → **Reason** (Articulation) → **Ethics** (Golden Rule Check) → **Consensus** (Integration) → **Logic** (Storage)

This flow embodies the hierarchy of GFF-1: Cognition is the ground, Reason is the process, Ethics is the practice, and Logic is the tool.

